alse, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "hardware": {"system_ram": "31861", "os": "Windows 11", "cpu_name": "AMD Ryzen 7 9700X 8-Core Processor             ", "adapter_description": "NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3090", "vram_size": 24326}, "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "232354363", "author": {"steamid": "76561198809086092", "personaname": "烤鱼啊嗯", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198809086092/", "num_games_owned": 21, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 4133, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 1810, "playtime_at_review": 980, "last_played": 1788067067, "avatar": "5e8f3be1c5473912a0303d89e071522f693be33b"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "沉浸感很强，可惜目前没人一起玩，还不太会", "timestamp_created": 1786202263, "timestamp_updated": 1786202263, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "232350053", "author": {"steamid": "76561199730140226", "personaname": "奥尔加 一直卡", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199730140226/", "num_games_owned": 45, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 20509, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 289, "playtime_at_review": 19696, "last_played": 1787821908, "avatar": "81754446048a38cc8ff11a3539c82e32e95619f9"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "游戏是好玩的，箭头是思幕的，在helldivers2这款游戏里你能体验到箭头为你准备的各种小巧思，包括但不限于潜兵武器是只有几把能玩的其他武器是要下各种毒的，能玩的武器还要塞到那个要1000蓝币剩下都是玩具的债券里面，完事你开了债券还不能立刻拿到里面的武器还要去打奖章去解锁，作为游戏核心的战备也是要整些花活的，有的红战备设计不知是何意味我都找不到它存在的意义，我们潜兵都指挥驱逐舰了怎么战备冷却还这么高难道上面是没有武器装填系统全是人力驱动吗你落地后叫完装备如果被箭木干死而装备还拿不回来的话你起码得再等8 9分钟冷却，用一次轨道支援后就要度过好几分钟的火力真空期(  持续作战能力还不如一架飞鹰呢(  执行任务中还有可能体验各种奇妙的事(  比如被箭木一脚踢进虫洞，泰坦亡语，莫名奇妙的物理碰撞之类的，搞不懂一个PVE游戏箭头竟然拼命去搞那个沟槽平衡性不让玩家爽，总之游戏是好玩的但是超级地球是支柱", "timestamp_created": 1786198686, "timestamp_updated": 1786198686, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "hardware": {"system_ram": "8130", "os": "Windows 10", "cpu_name": "Intel(R) Xeon(R) CPU E3-1220 v3 @ 3.10GHz", "adapter_description": "AMD Radeon RX 580 2048SP", "vram_size": 8170}, "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "232345314", "author": {"steamid": "76561199506664667", "personaname": "手感好的时候能找到电机", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199506664667/", "num_games_owned": 76, "num_reviews": 12, "playtime_forever": 8154, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 1038, "playtime_at_review": 7054, "last_played": 1787880695, "avatar": "05c9d811c75729caea21e24feb829e1f3f229b17"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "一段时间没玩下回来发现比别人少战备，也没地方买何意味。\n新加的控制终端点了大概率游戏卡死，", "timestamp_created": 1786194241, "timestamp_updated": 1786194241, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}]}